# Two requirements boundaries selected under delegated judgment; final allocation and acceptance pending.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Start: "Start here · Selected boundaries\nSingle process; final allocation pending" {class: start}
Calls: "Native reported observations\nResource keys / Bundle / UTType\nLS all URLs + NSWorkspace preferred"
Unknown: "Nil / missing / incomplete / failed\nUNKNOWN + affecting coverage\nNo inferred no-identifier fact"
Negative: "Selected registration meaning\nChecked LS not-found or full nonmatching array\nUndetected failure / stale state can mislead"
Ownership: "Retained owned account\nQ = roots + 2; at most 72 credits\nOpaque internals are outside its proof"
Lifetime: "Retained freeze + recovery\nLate return → worker-only close once\nProvider restart keeps blocked cohort"
Evidence: "Independently selected evidence\nComplete owned/hooks + native call envelopes\nOpaque acquisitions / peaks / errors unproved"
Listener: "Observe actual independent outcomes\nAccept error before suppression + backoff\nFresh clients / grant store / authorized actions"
Failures: "Acceptance still fails\nKnown wrong witnesses / resource error / backoff\nLost applicable events / inconclusive controls"
Decision: "Two decisions under delegation\nReported native facts + empirical evidence\nNo internal-health or hidden-safety proof" {shape: diamond}
Contract: "Remaining final allocation design\nNormalize results + two-credit ownership\nComplete handoff; retain other obligations"
Pending: "Then serviceability subjects + review\nBefore implementation planning\nNative / binary / useful coverage pending"
Start -> Calls: "1 · native semantics"
Start -> Ownership: "1 · preserve limits"
Calls -> Unknown: "2 · uncertain result"
Calls -> Negative: "2 · checked native negative"
Ownership -> Lifetime: "2"
Ownership -> Evidence: "2"
Evidence -> Listener: "3 · empirical subjects"
Listener -> Failures: "3 · failures still fail"
Unknown -> Decision: "4 · retain uncertainty"
Negative -> Decision: "4 · fact meaning"
Listener -> Decision: "4 · evidence scope"
Lifetime -> Decision: "4"
Decision -> Contract: "5 · finalize design"
Contract -> Pending: "6 · coherent handoff"
